    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Dexterity and Wisdom 13+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Defer Damage.</strong> When you take damage, reduce that damage by your Dexterity modifier (minimum of 1), then add a d6 to your Delayed Reaction pool. At the end of your turn, remove all the dice from the pool and roll them: you take Force damage equal to the total.</p><p><strong>Purify.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can remove a number of dice equal to your Wisdom modifier from your Delayed Reaction pool.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-QgiAsYGCDZTEZ6D8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Count the dice of your Delayed Reaction pool with the spent uses of this feat; at the end of your turn, roll that many d6 (change the number of dice in the dialog) and reset the uses.</p></section>",
